@startuml
actor User
participant ConsoleApplication
participant CalculateFeeUseCase
participant FeePolicy
User -> ConsoleApplication: amount
ConsoleApplication -> CalculateFeeUseCase: execute(amount)
CalculateFeeUseCase -> FeePolicy: calculate(amount)
FeePolicy --> CalculateFeeUseCase: fee
CalculateFeeUseCase --> ConsoleApplication: fee
ConsoleApplication --> User: formatted fee
@enduml
